<title>JORDAN: Table of outstanding auctioned Jordanian CDs.</title>
<headline>Table of outstanding auctioned Jordanian CDs.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table of outstanding three-month and six-month bi-monthly Jordan Central Bank certificates of deposit (CDs) sold in a market-dictated auction system which was introduced last month.</p>
<p>Jordan's outstanding 3-month certificates of deposit:</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE	VOLUME	 AV YIELD	RANGE</p>
<p>		    (million dinars)     (pct)	  (pct)</p>
<p> 2/7/97		 50		8.52     8.500-8.700</p>
<p>18/6/97		 35.0	    8.825    8.750-8.900</p>
<p>Jordan's outstanding 6-month certificates of deposit</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE	VOLUME	  AV YIELD	 RANGE</p>
<p>		    (million dinars)     (pct)	  (pct)</p>
<p> 2/7/97		 50		 8.75    8.625-8.8125</p>
<p>18/6/97		 15		 9.033    9.000-9.100</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman Newsroom + 9626-623776</p>
</text>
